--- !u!1001 &123627786
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 372886220}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 1042383192023770691, guid: f993b6645b84ec843997cb0669458cbd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Mom,\L\nI read your letter and went to the attic. I saw the box, the
        ribbon fraying. I didn\u2019t open it \u2014 not yet. Some truths feel heavier
        unopened.\nBut I think I know who you meant. I saw it in the pauses, the
        silences, the way you carried both presence and absence at once. Whatever
        is in that box, it does not change you. You were everything to me, mother
        and more.\nWhen the time is right, I\u2019ll untie it. Not to judge, but
        to carry what you couldn\u2019t say aloud. And when your memory goes, I\u2019ll
        remember for us both.\L\nYour son,\L Daniel"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1042383192023770691, guid: f993b6645b84ec843997cb0669458cbd, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
      value: 31
